<h2>18. Known Limitations &amp; Incomplete Parts</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>#</th>
<th>Limitation</th>
<th>Impact</th>
<th>Potential Fix</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody><tr>
<td>1</td>
<td><strong>No automated test suite</strong></td>
<td>Verification relies on CI build + manual testing</td>
<td>Add Vitest (frontend) + Jest (backend) with integration tests</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>2</td>
<td><strong>Render free tier cold starts</strong></td>
<td>Backend sleeps after ~15 min inactivity; first request takes ~30-60s</td>
<td>Upgrade to paid tier or add keep-alive ping</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>3</td>
<td><strong>No product image upload</strong></td>
<td><code>imageUrl</code> column exists but upload UI/storage removed</td>
<td>Re-add with S3, Vercel Blob, or Cloudinary</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>4</td>
<td><strong>Single-tenant</strong></td>
<td>No organization/multi-tenant separation</td>
<td>Add <code>organizationId</code> FK to all models</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>5</td>
<td><strong>PDF invoice not GST-compliant</strong></td>
<td>Print-ready but not e-invoicing/filing ready</td>
<td>Integrate GST API + proper invoice numbering</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>6</td>
<td><strong>Daily challan numbering resets</strong></td>
<td><code>CH-YYYYMMDD-NNN</code> resets each day; not globally gapless</td>
<td>Use database sequence or UUID-based numbering</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>7</td>
<td><strong>No refresh tokens / password reset</strong></td>
<td>JWTs valid until expiry; users must re-login</td>
<td>Add refresh token rotation + email-based password reset</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>8</td>
<td><strong>Stats computed on-the-fly</strong></td>
<td>Dashboard/landing queries run live; not cached</td>
<td>Add Redis cache or materialized views for scale</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>9</td>
<td><strong>Pagination returns one page</strong></td>
<td>Some list UIs only render the current page</td>
<td>Add &quot;load more&quot; or virtual scrolling for full dataset access</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>10</td>
<td><strong>No role self-service editing</strong></td>
<td>Users cannot change their own profile/password</td>
<td>Add profile edit endpoint + frontend page</td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
